        54.572994232177734,
        281.7030944824219,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "The following seven key questions were identified:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        74.24297332763672,
        526.7371215820312,
        87.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "1.\t PICO 1: What is the prevalence of LTBI, risk of progression to active TB and cumulative prevalence of active",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        88.24297332763672,
        492.3311767578125,
        101.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "TB among household contacts without HIV in different age groups in high TB incidence countries?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        107.91295623779297,
        526.6661987304688,
        120.71295928955078
      ],
      "text": "2.\t PICO 2: What is the accuracy of WHO symptomatic screening to exclude active TB in individuals with HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        121.91295623779297,
        228.86611938476562,
        134.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "on antiretroviral treatment (ART)?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.58294677734375,
        526.690185546875,
        154.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "3.\t PICO 3: What is the accuracy of symptomatic screening and/or chest x-ray to exclude active TB in contacts",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        155.58294677734375,
        367.0521240234375,
        168.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "of pulmonary TB cases without HIV in high TB incidence countries?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.250244140625,
        526.666259765625,
        188.05291748046875
      ],
      "text": "Could Interferon-gamma release assays be used as an alternative to tuberculin skin tests to  4.\t PICO 4: 1",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03709411621094,
        189.250244140625,
        496.0601806640625,
        202.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "identify individuals most at risk of progression from LTBI to active TB in high TB incidence settings?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        208.92022705078125,
        526.6661987304688,
        221.72021484375
      ],
      "text": "5.\t PICO 5: Should 3-month daily rifampicin plus isoniazid be offered as a preventive treatment option for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03709411621094,
        222.92022705078125,
        526.7064819335938,
        235.72021484375
      ],
      "text": "children and adolescents less than 15 years of age as an alternative to 6 or 9 months isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03709411621094,
        236.92022705078125,
        214.23910522460938,
        249.72021484375
      ],
      "text": "in high TB incidence countries?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        256.5902099609375,
        526.6951293945312,
        269.39019775390625
      ],
      "text": "6.\t PICO 6: Should 3-month weekly rifapentine and isoniazid be offered as an alternative regimen to isoniazid",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03709411621094,
        270.5902099609375,
        361.33514404296875,
        283.39019775390625
      ],
      "text": "monotherapy for treatment of LTBI in high TB incidence countries?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        290.26019287109375,
        524.3861694335938,
        303.0601806640625
      ],
      "text": "7.\t PICO 7: Should preventive treatment be recommended for contacts of patients with multidrug resistant /",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03709411621094,
        304.26019287109375,
        184.23912048339844,
        317.0601806640625
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin resistant-TB?",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        323.9302062988281,
        526.73046875,
        336.7301940917969
      ],
      "text": "A list of potential outcomes of interest for each question was circulated to all members of the GDG, who",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        337.9302062988281,
        526.7073974609375,
        350.7301940917969
      ],
      "text": "scored the importance of each outcome on a scale of 1 to 9: 1–3: not important; 4–6: important; and 7–9:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        351.9302062988281,
        526.6173706054688,
        364.7301940917969
      ],
      "text": "critical. The average of the scores for each outcome was used to prioritize the outcome and to select the most",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        365.9302062988281,
        526.7194213867188,
        378.7301940917969
      ],
      "text": "important outcomes for each PICO question. The outcomes selected for each question and the scores for their",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        190.87612915039062,
        379.8702087402344,
        260.5271301269531,
        392.8002014160156
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        379.9302062988281,
        265.3871154785156,
        392.7301940917969
      ],
      "text": "importance are presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        399.6002197265625,
        526.615234375,
        412.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "Seven new or updated systematic reviews were conducted for these guidelines. The existing recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        413.6002197265625,
        526.6970825195312,
        426.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "were discussed in the GDG and updated, as appropriate, including for clarity, as deemed necessary. Furthermore,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        427.6002197265625,
        526.720458984375,
        440.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "an online survey was conducted to determine the preferences and values of affected populations for the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        163.3170928955078,
        441.54022216796875,
        198.94308471679688,
        454.47021484375
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        441.6002197265625,
        526.6092529296875,
        454.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "management of LTBI ( ). A series of virtual meetings, co-chaired by a technical expert and a guideline",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        455.6002197265625,
        526.6892700195312,
        468.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "methodologist, were organized to appraise the evidence for each PICO and formulate recommendations. The",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        469.6002197265625,
        526.6401977539062,
        482.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "“evidence-to-decision” tables developed on the “GRADEpro interface” were used to guide discussions on",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        483.6002197265625,
        526.6741943359375,
        496.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "benefits and harm, the quality of the evidence, cost, feasibility, acceptability, equity, values and preferences",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        497.6002197265625,
        526.7243041992188,
        510.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": ". The recommendations and their strength were determined by the GDG on the basis of these factors.  (14)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        511.6002197265625,
        526.6715087890625,
        524.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "The guideline methodologist facilitated the discussions in order to reach consensus, which was defined as",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        525.6002197265625,
        526.6630859375,
        538.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "unanimous or majority agreement. Recommendations from existing WHO guidelines were initially assessed",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        539.6002197265625,
        526.6683959960938,
        552.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "by the steering group and were later discussed and approved by the GDG. Valid recommendations that did",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        553.6002197265625,
        526.7203369140625,
        566.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "not require updating were also included. The guidelines and the supporting documents were reviewed and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        567.6002197265625,
        526.6422729492188,
        580.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "endorsed by all GDG members. Remarks from the external review group were evaluated by the steering group",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        581.6002197265625,
        301.12603759765625,
        594.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "for incorporation into the final version of the guidelines.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        601.2702026367188,
        526.6904296875,
        614.0701904296875
      ],
      "text": "There are 10 existing, 7 updated and 7 new recommendations. The GRADE (grading of recommendations,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        615.2702026367188,
        526.7022094726562,
        628.0701904296875
      ],
      "text": "assessment, development and evaluation) tables for the seven new recommendations are presented in Annex",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        629.2702026367188,
        526.650390625,
        642.0701904296875
      ],
      "text": "1. The detailed evidence-to-decision tables for each PICO and the results of the systematic reviews are shown",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.68710327148438,
        643.210205078125,
        338.5912170410156,
        656.1401977539062
      ],
      "text": "Annex 2 Annex 3",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86709594726562,
        643.2702026367188,
        343.22711181640625,
        656.0701904296875
      ],
      "text": "in   and the survey on values and preferences in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.2247924804688,
        420.7922058105469,
        688.0078125
      ],
      "text": "1.6\t Quality of evidence and strength of the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.9429931640625,
        526.6152954101562,
        706.7429809570312
      ],
      "text": "The quality of evidence and the strength of the recommendations were assessed with the GRADE method",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.9429931640625,
        526.5991821289062,
        720.7429809570312
      ],
      "text": ". In this process, the quality of a body of evidence is defined as the degree of confidence that the estimates  (15)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.9429931640625,
        526.624267578125,
        734.7429809570312
      ],
      "text": "of effect (desirable or undesirable) are close to the actual effects of interest. The usefulness of an estimate of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.9277954101562,
        526.1748657226562,
        763.1677856445312
      ],
      "text": "This PICO was not included in the original scoping document submitted to the WHO Guidelines Review Committee but was added  1",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        762.9277954101562,
        449.6157531738281,
        773.1677856445312
      ],
      "text": "later at the suggestion of the GDG and in agreement with the Secretariat of the guidelines review committee.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        547.1427001953125,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "7",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
